This project contains Python modifications derived from Nunchaku components
distributed under the Apache License 2.0. Authoritative input wheels are
published by tonera/vitoom-nunchaku and contain upstream Nunchaku code and
compiled extensions. Derivative wheels retain the upstream license file.

The project-maintained changes add the FLUX.2 Klein attention callback API v3.
The repacker preserves the upstream compiled extension byte-for-byte and does
not represent that extension as independently rebuilt or source-reproducible.
